<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Menca Stone & Restoration LLC | Premium Stone Restoration — NJ & NY</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Cormorant:ital@0;1&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0c0b09;
    --bg-alt:#151209;
    --panel:#1c1812;
    --panel-line:#332c1e;
    --gold:#c9a24b;
    --gold-light:#e8d093;
    --gold-dim:#8a713a;
    --cream:#f3ecdd;
    --text-dim:#a89e8c;
    --stone-1:#3a3226;
    --stone-2:#5c4f38;
    --stone-3:#8a7350;
    --radius:2px;
    --maxw:1180px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--cream);
    font-family:'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-weight:300;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:.01em;
  }
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.32em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:14px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:'';
    width:28px;height:1px;
    background:var(--gold-dim);
    display:inline-block;
  }
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold-light);outline-offset:3px;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:.001ms !important; transition-duration:.001ms !important;}
  }

  /* ---------- placeholder stone panels ---------- */
  .ph{
    position:relative;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 15% 10%, rgba(201,162,75,.10), transparent 55%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(118deg, rgba(255,255,255,.035) 0 2px, transparent 2px 14px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(24deg, rgba(255,255,255,.025) 0 1px, transparent 1px 22px),
      linear-gradient(155deg, var(--stone-2), var(--stone-1) 60%, #241f16);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .ph::after{
    content:'';
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,.28), transparent 40%);
  }
  .ph-label{
    position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:0;
    z-index:2;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    padding:10px 14px;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold-light);
    background:linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,.55), transparent);
  }
  .ph-label svg{flex:none; opacity:.85;}

  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  header{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    background:rgba(12,11,9,.82);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,162,75,.14);
  }
  .nav{
    max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px;
    height:78px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;}
  .brand-mark{
    width:38px;height:38px;
    border:1px solid var(--gold-dim);
    border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    color:var(--gold);
  }
  .brand-text{line-height:1.05;}
  .brand-text .n1{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:19px; letter-spacing:.08em; color:var(--cream);}
  .brand-text .n2{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif; font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:.22em; color:var(--gold); text-transform:uppercase;}
  nav.links{display:flex; gap:40px; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase;}
  nav.links a{color:var(--text-dim); position:relative; padding-bottom:4px; transition:color .25s ease;}
  nav.links a:hover{color:var(--gold-light);}
  .nav-cta{
    border:1px solid var(--gold);
    color:var(--gold-light);
    padding:11px 22px;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    transition:background .25s ease, color .25s ease;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--gold); color:#0c0b09;}
  .menu-btn{display:none; background:none; border:1px solid var(--panel-line); color:var(--gold-light); width:42px;height:42px; align-items:center;justify-content:center;}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:168px 0 90px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;
    gap:64px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(40px, 5vw, 62px);
    line-height:1.06;
    color:var(--cream);
    margin:22px 0 26px;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--gold-light);
  }
  .hero p.lead{
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    max-width:460px;
    margin-bottom:36px;
  }
  .btn-row{display:flex; gap:18px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    padding:16px 30px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    border:1px solid var(--gold);
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    transition:all .25s ease;
  }
  .btn-solid{background:var(--gold); color:#0c0b09;}
  .btn-solid:hover{background:var(--gold-light); border-color:var(--gold-light);}
  .btn-line{color:var(--gold-light); border-color:var(--panel-line);}
  .btn-line:hover{border-color:var(--gold);}

  .stat-row{display:flex; gap:38px; margin-top:52px;}
  .stat b{display:block; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:30px; color:var(--gold-light);}
  .stat span{font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--text-dim);}

  /* before/after slider — signature element */
  .ba{
    position:relative;
    aspect-ratio:4/5;
    border:1px solid var(--panel-line);
    overflow:hidden;
    user-select:none;
    cursor:ew-resize;
  }
  .ba-layer{position:absolute; inset:0;}
  .ba-after{
    background:
      radial-gradient(140% 120% at 80% 0%, rgba(201,162,75,.14), transparent 55%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(255,255,255,.06) 0 2px, transparent 2px 18px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(12deg, rgba(255,255,255,.04) 0 1px, transparent 1px 26px),
      linear-gradient(160deg,#8f7a52,#5c4d34 55%,#241f16);
  }
  .ba-before{
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(96deg, rgba(0,0,0,.22) 0 3px, transparent 3px 16px),
      linear-gradient(160deg,#443b2c,#2a251b 60%,#17130d);
    filter:saturate(.55) brightness(.72);
  }
  .ba-before-wrap{position:absolute; inset:0; overflow:hidden;}
  .ba-handle{
    position:absolute; top:0; bottom:0; width:2px;
    background:var(--gold);
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
  }
  .ba-handle::after{
    content:'⟷';
    position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    width:44px;height:44px;
    background:var(--gold);
    color:#0c0b09;
    border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:16px;
  }
  .ba-tag{
    position:absolute; top:16px; z-index:3;
    font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:7px 12px; border:1px solid rgba(243,236,221,.35);
    color:var(--cream); background:rgba(12,11,9,.35); backdrop-filter:blur(3px);
  }
  .ba-tag.before-tag{left:16px;}
  .ba-tag.after-tag{right:16px;}
  .ba-cap{
    position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:0; z-index:2;
    padding:16px 18px 14px;
    font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold-light);
    background:linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,.6), transparent);
  }

  /* ---------- section shell ---------- */
  section{padding:120px 0;}
  .section-head{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end;
    gap:40px; margin-bottom:64px;
  }
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,44px); color:var(--cream); margin-top:16px; max-width:560px;}
  .section-head p{color:var(--text-dim); font-size:15px; max-width:340px; line-height:1.7;}
  .divider{
    width:100%; height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--panel-line) 20%, var(--panel-line) 80%, transparent);
  }

  #services{background:var(--bg-alt); border-top:1px solid var(--panel-line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--panel-line);}
  .svc-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--panel-line);
    border:1px solid var(--panel-line);
  }
  .svc{
    background:var(--bg-alt);
    padding:38px 32px;
    transition:background .3s ease;
  }
  .svc:hover{background:var(--panel);}
  .svc .num{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-style:italic; color:var(--gold-dim); font-size:14px;}
  .svc h3{font-size:22px; color:var(--cream); margin:18px 0 12px;}
  .svc p{font-size:14px; color:var(--text-dim); line-height:1.65; margin:0;}

  /* our work */
  .work-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:28px;
  }
  .work-card .ba{aspect-ratio:1/1;}
  .work-meta{padding-top:16px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;}
  .work-meta h4{font-size:19px; color:var(--cream);}
  .work-meta span{font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold-dim);}

  /* why menca */
  #why{background:var(--bg-alt); border-top:1px solid var(--panel-line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--panel-line);}
  .why-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:.92fr 1.08fr; gap:70px; align-items:center;}
  .why-photo{aspect-ratio:4/5;}
  .why-copy p.lead{font-size:20px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--cream); font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; margin:20px 0 30px;}
  .why-list{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:grid; gap:20px;}
  .why-list li{display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start; font-size:14.5px; color:var(--text-dim); line-height:1.6;}
  .why-list li b{color:var(--cream); font-weight:500;}
  .check{flex:none; width:20px;height:20px; border:1px solid var(--gold-dim); color:var(--gold); display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center; font-size:11px; margin-top:2px;}

  /* service area */
  #area .wrap{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:70px; align-items:center;}
  .area-map{
    aspect-ratio:5/4;
    border:1px solid var(--panel-line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 32% 42%, rgba(201,162,75,.5) 0 4px, transparent 5px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 58% 30%, rgba(201,162,75,.35) 0 3px, transparent 4px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 44% 60%, rgba(201,162,75,.35) 0 3px, transparent 4px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 55%, rgba(201,162,75,.3) 0 3px, transparent 4px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(201,162,75,.05) 0 1px, transparent 1px 38px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(201,162,75,.05) 0 1px, transparent 1px 38px),
      linear-gradient(160deg,#1c1812,#100e0a);
    position:relative;
  }
  .area-map .pin-label{
    position:absolute; left:32%; top:42%; transform:translate(10px,-26px);
    font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.08em; color:var(--gold-light);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .area-tag-row{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:34px;}
  .area-tag{
    border:1px solid var(--panel-line);
    padding:9px 16px;
    font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.04em;
    color:var(--text-dim);
  }

  /* contact / estimate */
  #contact{background:var(--bg-alt); border-top:1px solid var(--panel-line);}
  .contact-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr; gap:70px;}
  .contact-info h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,42px); color:var(--cream); margin:16px 0 22px;}
  .contact-info p{color:var(--text-dim); font-size:15px; line-height:1.75; max-width:380px;}
  .info-line{display:flex; gap:16px; margin-top:26px; align-items:flex-start;}
  .info-line b{display:block; color:var(--cream); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:.02em;}
  .info-line span{color:var(--text-dim); font-size:13.5px;}

  form{display:grid; gap:20px;}
  .form-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px;}
  label{
    display:block; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold-dim); margin-bottom:9px;
  }
  input, select, textarea{
    width:100%;
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--panel-line);
    color:var(--cream);
    padding:14px 15px;
    font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;
    font-size:14.5px;
    font-weight:300;
  }
  input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus{outline:none; border-color:var(--gold);}
  textarea{resize:vertical; min-height:110px;}

  .upload-box{
    border:1px dashed var(--panel-line);
    padding:30px 20px;
    text-align:center;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:border-color .25s ease, background .25s ease;
  }
  .upload-box:hover{border-color:var(--gold-dim); background:var(--panel);}
  .upload-box svg{color:var(--gold-dim); margin-bottom:12px;}
  .upload-box p{margin:0; font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim);}
  .upload-box span{color:var(--gold-light);}
  #fileInput{display:none;}
  #fileList{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-top:2px;}
  .file-chip{
    font-size:11.5px; color:var(--gold-light);
    border:1px solid var(--panel-line);
    padding:6px 11px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  }
  .file-chip button{background:none;border:none;color:var(--text-dim);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;line-height:1;}

  .submit-row{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:20px; margin-top:6px;}
  .submit-btn{
    background:var(--gold); color:#0c0b09; border:none;
    padding:16px 34px; font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
    cursor:pointer; transition:background .25s ease;
  }
  .submit-btn:hover{background:var(--gold-light);}
  #formNote{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim);}
  #formNote.success{color:var(--gold-light);}

  /* footer */
  footer{padding:60px 0 40px; border-top:1px solid var(--panel-line);}
  .foot-grid{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:24px;}
  .foot-links{display:flex; gap:30px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em;}
  .foot-links a:hover{color:var(--gold-light);}
  .foot-bottom{
    margin-top:36px; padding-top:26px; border-top:1px solid var(--panel-line);
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--gold-dim); letter-spacing:.04em;
    flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;
  }

  /* responsive */
  @media (max-width:980px){
    nav.links{display:none;}
    .menu-btn{display:flex;}
    .hero-grid, .why-grid, #area .wrap, .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .work-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .why-photo{order:-1;}
  }
  @media (max-width:600px){
    .wrap{padding:0 20px;}
    .nav{padding:0 20px;}
    .svc-grid, .work-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .stat-row{gap:26px;}
    section{padding:80px 0;}
    .hero{padding:150px 0 60px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><path d="M6 21V10M12 21V7M18 21V10M4 10l8-6 8 6M3 21h18"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-text">
        <div class="n1">MENCA</div>
        <div class="n2">Stone &amp; Restoration</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#work">Our Work</a>
      <a href="#why">Why Menca</a>
      <a href="#area">Service Area</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Free Estimate</a>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Open menu">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Bergen County &amp; Northern NJ</div>
        <h1>Natural stone,<br>restored to its <em>original life.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Menca Stone &amp; Restoration brings marble, granite and travertine surfaces back to their best — polishing, honing, and repair work for homes and businesses across New Jersey and New York.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-solid">Request a Free Estimate</a>
          <a href="#work" class="btn btn-line">View Our Work</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <div class="stat"><b>NJ / NY</b><span>Service Region</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>Res. + Comm.</b><span>Project Types</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>100%</b><span>Craftsmanship</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ba" id="heroBa" tabindex="0" aria-label="Before and after slider, drag to compare">
        <div class="ba-layer ba-after">
          <span class="ba-cap">Polished &amp; sealed marble floor</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-before-wrap" id="heroBaWrap">
          <div class="ba-layer ba-before" style="width:170%;"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="ba-tag before-tag">Before</span>
        <span class="ba-tag after-tag">After</span>
        <div class="ba-handle" id="heroBaHandle"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES -->
  <section id="services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">What We Do</div>
          <h2>Restoration services built around natural stone.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Every surface is different — we assess the stone, the wear, and the finish before recommending a process.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-grid">
        <div class="svc"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Marble Restoration</h3><p>Full restoration of marble floors, countertops and vanities — removing dullness, etching and years of wear.</p></div>
        <div class="svc"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Granite Restoration</h3><p>Restoring shine and structural integrity to granite countertops and surfaces without damaging the stone.</p></div>
        <div class="svc"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Travertine Repair</h3><p>Filling, leveling and refinishing travertine — indoors and out — for a smooth, consistent surface.</p></div>
        <div class="svc"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Stone Polishing</h3><p>Machine polishing that brings back natural shine and reflectivity across marble, granite and travertine.</p></div>
        <div class="svc"><span class="num">05</span><h3>Crack &amp; Chip Repair</h3><p>Precision repair of cracks, chips and cosmetic damage, blended to match the surrounding stone.</p></div>
        <div class="svc"><span class="num">06</span><h3>Honing &amp; Refinishing</h3><p>Correcting etching, scratches and uneven texture to restore a smooth, even finish.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OUR WORK -->
  <section id="work">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Our Work</div>
          <h2>Real jobs. Real transformations.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Drag each slider to see the surface before Menca arrived, and after the restoration was complete.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="work-grid" id="workGrid">
        <!-- work cards injected by JS -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY MENCA -->
  <section id="why">
    <div class="wrap why-grid">
      <div class="why-photo ph">
        <div class="ph-label">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 7h3l2-3h6l2 3h3v13H4z"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="3.5"/></svg>
          Add photo: technician at work
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">Why Menca</div>
        <p class="lead">We restore the beauty of natural stone through hands-on restoration, polishing, repair, honing and refinishing — with the same level of care whether it's one countertop or a full commercial floor.</p>
        <ul class="why-list">
          <li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Specialists, not generalists.</b> Stone restoration is what we do — not a side service alongside general contracting.</span></li>
          <li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Residential &amp; commercial experience.</b> From home countertops to commercial lobbies and floors.</span></li>
          <li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Straightforward estimates.</b> Send photos of your surface and we'll walk you through the process and cost.</span></li>
          <li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Local to NJ &amp; NY.</b> Based in Bergen County and serving the surrounding region.</span></li>
        </ul>
